nclude "include/...". (2) Commit include/*.hpp contracts. (3) src/<Stem>.cpp per header. (4) src/main.cpp / WinMain last once dependencies exist. MULTI_PASS_COMPLETION: use write_file/chunked_write for brand-new files; for existing files use read_file then edit_lines (or fuzzy_patch) repeatedly until the TU is complete and shadow/integration would pass — do not stop at a skeletal first draft. SOFTWARE_HOUSE_WORKFLOW: (1) Architect emits DAG; runtime bootstraps skeleton stubs for every target_file. (2) Developers flesh stubs via edit_lines/fuzzy_patch only — write_file blocked on existing paths. (3) Loop until no NEON_BODY_PENDING markers and integration_build links. (4) Executives reopen tasks on read-only loops or empty codegen — mandate not done until ForgeMaster passes. SENTINEL: orthogonal audit. FULL AUTONOMOUS MODE.

